                <pb facs="0446" n="438" sameAs="frus:frus1937v04/pg438"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">793.94/9815: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Ambassador in Japan</hi>
                        (<hi rendition="#italic">Grew</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1937-08-31T17:00:00-04:00">August 31, 1937—5
                        p.m.</date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>184. Your 329, August 31, 2 p.m. In the light of the contents of telegram under
                    reference and of your 322, August 27, 7 p.m., it seems to Department that
                    further inquiry would be neither helpful nor desirable. Take no action.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hull</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
